      "snippet": {
        "line": 145,
        "text": "cylindricalCurl Dr Dθ Dz q A = ![q * Dθ (A 2) - Dz (A 1), Dz (A 0) - Dr (A 2), Dr (A 1) + q * A 1 - q * Dθ (A 0)] — the general cylindrical curl, not the display; the display is its specialization at A = (0, Ψ, 0) (and ∂_θ = 0), which gives (-Dz Ψ, 0, Dr Ψ + qΨ) with q = r⁻¹"
      }
    }
  }
